  "job_B14.46_20260920_210305": {
    "chunk_text": "Be wergildum & be ge\u00f0in\u00f0um. Hwilum w\u00e6s, \u00fe\u00e6t leod & lagu for be ge\u00feing\u00f0um; & \u00fea w\u00e6ron \u00feeodwitan wur\u00f0scipes wur\u00f0e, \u00e6lc be his And gif ceorl ge\u00feeah, \u00fe\u00e6t he h\u00e6fde V hida fullice agenes landes, bellan & burhgeat, setl & sundornote And se \u00feegen \u00fee ge\u00feeah, \u00fe\u00e6t he \u00feenode cynge & his radst\u00e6fne rad on his hirede, gif se \u00feonne h\u00e6fde And se \u00f0e swa ge\u00feogene forwyrhtan n\u00e6fde, swore for silfne \u00e6fter his rihte, o\u00f0\u00f0e his \u00feolode. And gif leornere w\u00e6re, \u00fee \u00feurh lare ge\u00feuge, \u00fe\u00e6t he had h\u00e6fde & \u00feenode Criste, w\u00e6re se si\u00f0\u00f0an m\u00e6\u00f0e & And gif man gehadedum o\u00f0\u00f0e \u00e6l\u00feeodigum ahwar gederede wordes o\u00f0\u00f0e weorces, \u00feonne gebyrede.",
